   "summary": "",
   "identity": "Bound by fracture and sustained by graft, the Templar is a living vessel of a higher will. Their power does not flow freely it is drawn, stored, and released with purpose. Each fracture of the Lock deepens the bond between bearer and Luminarkon, shaping them into a conduit of divine, infernal, or void-touched force.\n\nThe Templar is a finite resource frontloaded endurance class. They do not regenerate power in combat. Instead, they prepare, conserve, and unleash stored Chakra with precision. Their strength lies in controlled bursts, marked pressure, and the gradual unraveling of the Lock.",
