     "name": "Brawn and Bastion",
     "type": "",
     "flavor": "",
     "cost": "",
     "description": "**Might Is Right**\nWhile wearing Heavy or Super Heavy Armor, your AC increases by half your Brawn modifier (maximum +6)\n\n**Brawn and Grit**\nWhile wearing no armor, your statistics change as follows:\n- +35 ft to maximum movement speed\n- EC = 5 + Dexterity + (2 Per 2,500 ascension)\n- AC = 10 + Strength + (3 Per 2,500 ascension)\n- Critical Resistance Modifier = Brawn Skill\n- Epic Critical Resistance Modifier = half your Brawn or Dodge Skill\n- Stance = Strength + Brawn + (5 Per 2,000 ascension)\n- Arcane Resist = Dexterity + intelligence + 2",
     "grants": "",
