     "cost": "",
     "description": "While in combat, if you have at least one free hand, you are treated as if you have a +1 (1)(1) shield equipped. Additionally, once per round, you may spend 2 RP to attempt to reduce damage from an attack against you by making a Resistance Skill Check equal to half the creature's total hit roll.",
     "grants": "",
