     "name": "Improvised Mastery",
     "type": "",
     "flavor": "",
     "cost": "",
     "description": "Your understanding of chaos has become deliberate.\n- Improvised weapons you wield gain +1 Critical Threshold.\n- When you score a Critical Hit with an improvised weapon, you may choose:\n  - The target suffers +3 Stance damage\n  - The target gets pushed back 10ft\n  - The target has pushed prone with on a 1d4 (4) 25%",
