     "type": "",
     "flavor": "Force does not vanish—it transfers.",
     "cost": "",
     "description": "When you hit a creature with a melee attack after moving at least 10 ft in a straight line toward it, choose one of the following effects:\n- The target takes +3 bonus damage and is pushed 5 ft directly away from you, or\n- You convert the impact into internal stress, dealing +4 Stance damage instead of bonus damage\nIf the target collides with a solid object, creature, or terrain feature due to this push, they take an additional 2 damage. This effect may trigger once per turn.",
